OL,3,ATwo Renoir paintings stolen from French
OL,4,Amuseum are recovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo paintings by Auguste Renoir stolen
OL,7,Fa month ago from a museum in the south
OL,8,Fof France have been recovered, the
OL,9,Flocal town hall has said.
OL,11,FThe two works were seized on 8
OL,12,FSeptember when thieves cut through a
OL,13,Ffence and smashed a window at the
OL,14,FRenoir Museum in Cagnes-sur-Mer, where
OL,15,Fthe French impressionist had lived
OL,16,Fduring his final years.
OL,18,FThe local mayor praised authorities for
OL,19,Frecovering the paintings and said the
OL,20,Fnews gave immense joy and profound
OL,21,Frelief.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
