OL,3,ATwo Renoir paintings stolen from French
OL,4,Amuseum are recovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix suspects have also been arrested in
OL,7,Frelation with the heist at Renoir
OL,8,FMuseum, the town hall confirmed in a
OL,9,Fstatement.
